  "jurisdiction": "HU",
  "note": "Hungary hangs the whole period on one document: without a signed teljesitesigazolas there is no lawful invoice, and the dispute that follows a refused one has its own forum rather than the courts. So this layer surfaces register, measure, certify, invoice, clock, deadlines and escalate, and the escalation slot names the expert body rather than a letter.",
  "slug": "get-the-teljesitesigazolas-signed-and-invoice-the-period",
